# Three Ideas [Thurs, Sept 11, 2025]{color=red} at midnight

=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Three Ideas for BioTech Products

@body

- Come up with three ideas for biotech products.
- Think about the sectors and consumers of the products
- Most important of all follow your own personal interests
- Submit to Google Forms.
  - You can adapt some of the previous years' ideas
  - At least one novel idea not listed on following pages.

=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Three Ideas Not in Modern Biotechnology

@body

- Health-monitoring glasses (🛑 Medical Devices)
  - This idea is about designing wearable glasses with sensors to track body signals and flag health issues. It is mainly an engineering and hardware project and would require skills in electronics and device design.
- Smart health watch (🛑 Bio-engineering)
  - This proposal centers on a smartwatch that monitors vital signs using biosensors. It is a biomedical engineering and data-analytics challenge
- Antibiotic bandage (🛑 Drug Manufacturing)
  - This concept focuses on a wound dressing that detects infection and releases antibiotics. It relies on drug formulation and materials engineering
- Irish Moss Extract for Limb Regeneration (🛑 Traditional Remedies)
  - This project suggests extracting compounds from Irish moss and applying them as a gel to promote limb regrowth. Because it relies on natural extracts and makes speculative therapeutic claims.
  - Instead of relying on natural extracts, this project could focus on genetically engineering seaweed or algae to produce specific growth factors or signaling proteins that are known to influence tissue repair and regeneration.

