=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Three Ideas → One Good Idea

@body

- I will post a template on Google Forms to complete
- Question on the Google Form\:
  - What is the title of your great idea? \[1 sentence\] \*
  - Write a brief description of your great idea. \[2-3 sentences\] \*
  - How do you decide on this great idea? \[1-2 sentences\] \*
  - What is the marketable product of this great idea? \[1 sentence\] \*
  - How will you use of living systems to make your product for great idea? \[1 sentence\] \*
  - Explain the science behind your great idea? \[1-2 sentences\] \*
  - What needs to get done to start producing your product? \[1-2 sentences\] \*
  - What competitors or competition exists? None is not an acceptable answer. \[1-2 sentences\] \*
  - How would the public respond to your idea? Is it controversial? \[1-2 sentences\] \*
  - Who or what type of groups would buy it? \[1-2 sentences\] \*
  - How many products can you sell to one individual person or company? \*
  - What subfield of biotechnology from class is your idea best categorized? \*
  - Rank how much you like this great idea? \*
  - Rank how practical/realistic you think idea #1 can be? \*

