@body

- Instructor reference screenshot omitted because it exposed a student filename.

=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Executive Summary Rubric

@body

- Cover Page (10%)
    - Nice looking cover page. Effective name of company
- Problem (15%)
    - Clearly establish the problem
- Background (15%)
    - Explain the background to the problem and provide a scientific basis
- Solution (15%)
    - Provide a solution to the problem and clearly describe the product.
- Business Model (15%)
    - Has a good business model, establishes market need, sets the niche for the product
- Enthusiasm (15%)
    - Summary is enthusiastic about the product and fun to read
- Style (15%)
    - Overall clean look, good font choice, solid formatting, full justification of text, good use of white space.

=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Most Common Errors

@body

- Similarity scores above 10% will lose points
- Executive summary does not hit all major areas\:
  - Background, Problem, Solution, Scientific Basis, Business Model, Competition
    - I am not concerned about the order, but it needs to make sense
- Background portion does not provide any background information

